WEBVTT

00:03.860 --> 00:04.900
<b>He can do it!</b>

00:05.270 --> 00:09.480
<b>He didn't even flinch
from a blow by the Battosai.</b>

00:09.480 --> 00:11.610
<b>Can this really be—</b>

00:11.610 --> 00:14.700
<b>You really are stupid.</b>

00:15.570 --> 00:19.290
<b>His prized zanbato was easily dodged.</b>

00:19.700 --> 00:22.790
<b>No matter how he goes about it,
there's no way Zanza can win.</b>

00:23.040 --> 00:24.710
<b>Huh? Then—</b>

00:24.710 --> 00:25.750
<b>Don't worry.</b>

00:26.250 --> 00:27.540
<b>I have a plan.</b>

00:29.170 --> 00:32.760
<b>Things will go as I had planned after all!</b>

00:34.800 --> 00:39.260
<b>Hey, Battosai.
Are you okay with a stance like that?</b>

00:39.720 --> 00:42.850
<b>Your attack won't work against me.</b>

00:43.140 --> 00:45.100
<b>No need to worry.</b>

00:45.100 --> 00:49.060
<b>More like now is the time for you
to sheathe your sword, that it is.</b>

00:51.030 --> 00:54.530
<b>Where in the world
is there a sheath for this thing?</b>

00:56.030 --> 00:59.700
<b>I can't start a fight
and finish it half-assed.</b>

01:00.780 --> 01:04.040
<b>Let's get act two of this fight started!</b>

02:35.000 --> 02:39.010
<b>EPISODE 5:
AND THEN, ANOTHER</b>

02:58.990 --> 03:00.450
<b>The distance...</b>

03:02.870 --> 03:04.990
<b>Take this, Battosai!</b>

03:20.380 --> 03:23.840
<b>Zanza, one blow
does not work against you.</b>

03:24.220 --> 03:25.050
<b>If so...</b>

03:26.970 --> 03:28.100
<b>Consecutive attacks!</b>

03:33.770 --> 03:34.610
<b>He did it!</b>

03:38.030 --> 03:39.240
<b>So strong...</b>

03:39.740 --> 03:41.820
<b>Hiten Mitsurugi-ryu...</b>

03:41.820 --> 03:42.740
<b>Ryuusosen.</b>

03:43.530 --> 03:46.780
<b>Zanbato, due to
its super-heavyweight nature,</b>

03:46.780 --> 03:49.290
<b>limits the form of attack.</b>

03:49.750 --> 03:53.210
<b>Either you swing down or sweep.
There are only two choices.</b>

03:54.710 --> 03:56.590
<b>Quite an easy read.</b>

03:57.290 --> 03:59.460
<b><i>He isn't just at another level.</i></b>

03:59.880 --> 04:01.760
<b><i>There's an entire magnitude
of a difference.</i></b>

04:01.760 --> 04:04.300
<b><i>I didn't think he would be this strong.</i></b>

04:05.760 --> 04:06.930
<b><i>I can't win.</i></b>

04:07.720 --> 04:09.010
<b>This is not act two.</b>

04:09.520 --> 04:11.230
<b>This is the epilogue, that it is.</b>

04:12.560 --> 04:14.560
<b>Let us stop meaningless combat.</b>

04:15.060 --> 04:18.770
<b>Moreover, I do not want to point my sword
against you any longer, that I don't.</b>

04:19.780 --> 04:22.070
<b>Calmly admit your defeat, that you should.</b>

04:25.240 --> 04:26.490
<b>Saga—</b>

04:27.450 --> 04:30.410
<b>Captain... Sagara...</b>

04:33.460 --> 04:36.330
<b>TEN YEARS AGO
TOSANDO</b>

04:38.540 --> 04:40.050
<b>What the hell is that?</b>

04:40.250 --> 04:43.590
<b>That's the Sekiho Army,
the vanguard of the Imperial Army.</b>

04:44.130 --> 04:46.090
<b>What are they doing so far north?</b>

04:46.300 --> 04:48.930
<b>They're going around with word
of the Land Tax Halving Order.</b>

04:48.930 --> 04:51.100
<b>If the Imperialist forces
take over the Shogunate,</b>

04:51.100 --> 04:52.980
<b>apparently our land tax
will be cut in half.</b>

04:53.730 --> 04:55.770
<b>That's a good thing to hear.</b>

04:56.730 --> 05:00.900
<b><i>In 1868, the Sekiho Army was formed
as a nationalist squad</i></b>

05:00.900 --> 05:03.860
<b><i>immediately after
the Battle of Toba-Fushimi,</i></b>

05:03.860 --> 05:05.990
<b><i>consisting of civilian
and nonofficial personnel.</i></b>

05:06.910 --> 05:10.910
<b><i>They scouted the roadside domains
ahead of the Imperial Army,</i></b>

05:10.910 --> 05:12.450
<b><i>the Revolutionary warriors.</i></b>

05:12.950 --> 05:17.330
<b><i>They served as the guide and vanguard
that assisted the main forces.</i></b>

05:18.040 --> 05:21.800
<b><i>The First Unit of the Sekiho Army,
led by Sozo Sagara</i></b>

05:21.340 --> 05:24.170
<b>OLD KYOTO

SETA</b>

05:21.340 --> 05:25.470
<b>MISAKA PASS

SONOHARA</b>

05:21.340 --> 05:26.590
<b>USUI PASS</b>

05:21.800 --> 05:23.840
<b>had been heading north along Tosando,</b>

05:23.840 --> 05:28.760
<b>relaying the Land Tax Halving Order
declared by the Revolutionary warriors.</b>

05:24.170 --> 05:25.880
<b>OLD KYOTO</b>

05:25.470 --> 05:28.510
<b>MISAKA PASS</b>

05:26.590 --> 05:28.760
<b>TAGAJO

USUI PASS</b>

05:29.510 --> 05:31.310
<b>Once we're past the village, we will rest.</b>

05:31.640 --> 05:32.470
<b>Yes, sir!</b>

05:39.520 --> 05:41.770
<b>Captain! The meal's almost done!</b>

05:42.780 --> 05:44.690
<b>Wait, what are you doing?</b>

05:45.440 --> 05:46.280
<b>Look.</b>

05:47.200 --> 05:48.240
<b>That?</b>

05:48.570 --> 05:49.820
<b>It's just some smoke.</b>

05:50.320 --> 05:54.120
<b>It means they have firewood to burn
and meals to eat.</b>

05:55.370 --> 05:57.250
<b>Don't you think that's a great thing?</b>

05:57.250 --> 05:58.120
<b>Of course...</b>

05:58.960 --> 06:02.710
<b>I have seen many villages
where fires wouldn't burn.</b>

06:05.800 --> 06:08.010
<b>Watch closely, Sanosuke.</b>

06:09.090 --> 06:11.680
<b>The 300-year domination
of Tokugawa is about to end,</b>

06:11.680 --> 06:13.680
<b>raising the curtains on a new era.</b>

06:14.350 --> 06:17.980
<b>An age where the weak are abused
and had to cry in their sleep will end,</b>

06:17.980 --> 06:20.770
<b>and an era of equality
for the four classes</b>

06:20.770 --> 06:22.730
<b>with no man standing
over another, will begin.</b>

06:23.730 --> 06:26.240
<b>We of the Sekiho Army
stand at the front line.</b>

06:26.490 --> 06:32.580
<b>"How hard we work will determine
if that is in one year or ten," right?</b>

06:33.080 --> 06:35.660
<b>Katsuhiro and I
have heard it countless times.</b>

06:36.200 --> 06:40.040
<b>I see. That means the future
of the Sekiho Army is also secure.</b>

06:42.460 --> 06:43.290
<b>Hey, Captain.</b>

06:43.880 --> 06:45.170
<b>If changing the world succeeds</b>

06:45.170 --> 06:48.970
<b>and we get this era of equality
for the four classes,</b>

06:49.260 --> 06:52.760
<b>will I, the son of a farmer,
proudly be able to have a surname?</b>

06:53.260 --> 06:54.390
<b>Yeah.</b>

06:54.390 --> 06:57.680
<b>Then, can I use
the last name Sagara, Captain?</b>

06:58.230 --> 07:00.900
<b>Sanosuke Sagara, huh?</b>

07:01.190 --> 07:02.230
<b>Yeah!</b>

07:02.230 --> 07:03.650
<b>Stop it.</b>

07:03.650 --> 07:05.730
<b>You'll end up with a strange name.</b>

07:05.730 --> 07:08.070
<b>It's not strange. It's the best!</b>

07:09.030 --> 07:11.910
<b>If you're fine with it, do as you wish.</b>

07:13.490 --> 07:14.330
<b>Okay!</b>

07:16.740 --> 07:18.620
<b>Impossible! We are—</b>

07:18.620 --> 07:21.040
<b>You say the Sekiho Army
is a fake Imperial Army?</b>

07:21.250 --> 07:23.750
<b>The Government-General
ordered units from each region</b>

07:23.750 --> 07:27.710
<b>to capture "the Sekiho Army,
a fake Imperial Army."</b>

07:27.840 --> 07:30.550
<b>My squad stationed at Usui Pass
has been eradicated!</b>

07:31.050 --> 07:32.340
<b>No way!</b>

07:32.340 --> 07:34.140
<b>What in the world? Why?</b>

07:36.010 --> 07:38.850
<b>They cut us off!
The Land Tax Halving Order</b>

07:38.850 --> 07:41.980
<b>that the Sekiho Army was relaying
was becoming a nuisance!</b>

07:42.100 --> 07:43.520
<b>What do you mean?</b>

07:43.850 --> 07:46.520
<b>In order to gain support
of farmers in each region,</b>

07:46.520 --> 07:48.780
<b>they promised the Land Tax Halving Order.</b>

07:48.780 --> 07:51.450
<b>With the financial difficulties
of the Imperialist government,</b>

07:51.450 --> 07:53.110
<b>they can't possibly go through with it.</b>

07:53.110 --> 07:55.780
<b>That's why they framed the Sekiho Army
as a fake Imperial Army</b>

07:55.780 --> 07:58.120
<b>and pretend none of it never happened.</b>

07:58.870 --> 08:00.870
<b>What should we do, Captain Sagara?</b>

08:00.870 --> 08:01.710
<b>Captain!</b>

08:02.460 --> 08:04.880
<b>We can't go against
the Government-General.</b>

08:05.330 --> 08:08.340
<b>For now, we can head over
to the stronghold in Shimosuwa.</b>

08:08.800 --> 08:12.050
<b>Sanosuke, Katsuhiro,
both of you wait here.</b>

08:13.220 --> 08:14.430
<b>What do you mean by that?</b>

08:14.930 --> 08:17.010
<b>You guys are still young.</b>

08:17.010 --> 08:19.680
<b>I can't afford to take you any further.</b>

08:19.890 --> 08:20.720
<b>Captain.</b>

08:21.310 --> 08:22.390
<b>Captain.</b>

08:23.640 --> 08:25.560
<b>It'll be fine. Don't worry.</b>

08:26.860 --> 08:28.070
<b>Keep watch while we're away.</b>

08:37.780 --> 08:39.200
<b>Captain Sagara.</b>

08:47.460 --> 08:48.880
<b>Sanosuke!</b>

08:48.880 --> 08:50.210
<b>What's wrong, Katsuhiro?</b>

08:52.800 --> 08:53.630
<b>Our captain!</b>

08:57.510 --> 08:59.560
<b>Let me through! Come on, let me through!</b>

08:59.930 --> 09:00.760
<b>Captain!</b>

09:01.140 --> 09:01.970
<b>Captain.</b>

09:03.730 --> 09:04.600
<b>Capt—</b>

09:07.270 --> 09:11.980
<b>"Fake Imperial Army, Sekiho Army,
First Unit Captain, Sozo Sagara.</b>

09:11.980 --> 09:14.610
<b>Sentenced to beheading
for the crime of using falsehoods</b>

09:14.610 --> 09:17.990
<b>such as halving land tax
to deceive the minds of people," huh?</b>

09:17.990 --> 09:20.450
<b>Don't make us happy prematurely, I say.</b>

09:21.290 --> 09:23.750
<b>The Sekiho Army is a bunch of criminals!</b>

09:28.000 --> 09:30.630
<b><i>His spirit that was almost gone
has returned?</i></b>

09:32.090 --> 09:33.960
<b>I can't lose.</b>

09:34.720 --> 09:37.680
<b>I can't lose!</b>

09:41.760 --> 09:43.060
<b>He stood up!</b>

09:43.520 --> 09:45.390
<b><i>His spirit is stronger than ever.</i></b>

09:46.310 --> 09:48.520
<b>They made Captain Sagara...</b>

09:48.850 --> 09:52.820
<b>They made us, the Sekiho Army,
bear the burden of the bad letter</b>

09:52.820 --> 09:55.740
<b>while those Imperialists
look like they're the face of justice.</b>

09:56.360 --> 09:58.740
<b>I absolutely can't let myself lose!</b>

09:58.950 --> 10:00.320
<b>Sekiho Army?</b>

10:02.830 --> 10:03.660
<b>Kenshin!</b>

10:06.000 --> 10:07.120
<b>Amazing!</b>

10:07.120 --> 10:09.210
<b>He landed a blow!</b>

10:10.710 --> 10:13.590
<b><i>So much strength,
even after getting hit with Ryuusosen.</i></b>

10:14.000 --> 10:15.300
<b><i>He is quite the man.</i></b>

10:19.090 --> 10:20.430
<b><i>All right! Now!</i></b>

10:20.640 --> 10:22.850
<b>Die, Battosai!</b>

10:24.680 --> 10:25.890
<b>No!</b>

10:29.480 --> 10:30.310
<b>Kenshin...</b>

10:32.480 --> 10:33.610
<b>B-Bro?</b>

10:33.860 --> 10:38.110
<b>A plan finally works when you double down,
even triple down, on your tactics!</b>

10:38.240 --> 10:41.490
<b>Your luck ended at the moment
you thought I only had one gun!</b>

10:47.960 --> 10:48.910
<b>Kenshin!</b>

10:52.630 --> 10:54.630
<b>He clearly saw the trajectory</b>

10:54.630 --> 10:56.880
<b>and reacted with the sword guard...</b>

10:57.550 --> 10:59.550
<b>However, what about this?</b>

11:02.180 --> 11:04.890
<b>Gohei, make sure the brats can't escape!</b>

11:04.890 --> 11:07.180
<b>Make sure they can't escape, Bro?</b>

11:07.180 --> 11:08.480
<b>Break their legs!</b>

11:09.690 --> 11:10.690
<b>I see.</b>

11:10.690 --> 11:11.940
<b>Damn it!</b>

11:12.230 --> 11:14.440
<b>Kaoru, this ain't the time to space out!</b>

11:14.440 --> 11:15.360
<b>Hurry up, and run!</b>

11:15.690 --> 11:18.320
<b>I can't.
I'm weak in the knees seeing that...</b>

11:18.320 --> 11:19.490
<b>Huh?</b>

11:19.490 --> 11:20.650
<b>I can't help it!</b>

11:20.650 --> 11:22.780
<b>You're the one that needs
to hurry on out of here!</b>

11:22.780 --> 11:24.830
<b>I'll somehow make do here!</b>

11:24.830 --> 11:26.740
<b>You can't do anything about this!</b>

11:28.200 --> 11:30.290
<b>Writhe! Struggle!</b>

11:35.670 --> 11:37.590
<b>I thought I told you.</b>

11:37.590 --> 11:39.010
<b>This is my fight.</b>

11:39.510 --> 11:41.760
<b>I won't allow anyone to get in my way!</b>

11:41.880 --> 11:42.720
<b>Zan—</b>

11:43.090 --> 11:45.300
<b>I ain't gonna lose!</b>

11:45.300 --> 11:47.680
<b>I can't afford to lose here!</b>

11:48.720 --> 11:49.560
<b>Kihei.</b>

11:51.770 --> 11:54.020
<b>You really are a hopeless soul.</b>

11:54.270 --> 11:55.230
<b>Enough nonsense!</b>

11:55.610 --> 11:56.440
<b>Huh?</b>

11:59.400 --> 12:02.150
<b>I eased up enough
for you to not fall unconscious.</b>

12:02.660 --> 12:04.700
<b>You can have a taste of living hell
for a bit.</b>

12:07.410 --> 12:12.080
<b>The burden of the word "bad" really
should be on the backs of folks like you.</b>

12:12.580 --> 12:16.540
<b>No... it should be us,
the Revolutionary warriors.</b>

12:20.380 --> 12:22.050
<b>Let's settle the score...</b>

12:23.590 --> 12:26.680
<b>Mr. Strongest Imperialist!</b>

12:28.390 --> 12:29.390
<b>All right.</b>

12:30.060 --> 12:31.850
<b>We shall settle the score, that we shall.</b>

12:33.850 --> 12:34.730
<b>Kenshin!</b>

12:40.940 --> 12:43.950
<b>RUROUNI KENSHIN</b>

12:47.120 --> 12:49.870
<b>Here goes, Battosai!</b>

12:52.330 --> 12:54.960
<b>What? What's he planning on doing?</b>

12:55.290 --> 12:58.590
<b>Centripetal force! He's adding
centripetal force from the spin</b>

12:58.590 --> 13:02.010
<b>on top of his innate strength
and weight of the zanbato!</b>

13:04.430 --> 13:10.180
<b>Ever since the fall of the Sekiho Army,
I spent all my time in street fights!</b>

13:10.600 --> 13:14.890
<b>I could forget about everything
when I was fighting!</b>

13:15.100 --> 13:18.360
<b>And in ten years, I've gotten stronger!</b>

13:18.610 --> 13:23.320
<b>With that strength,
I will defeat the strongest Imperialist!</b>

13:24.280 --> 13:28.280
<b>Such meager strength
won't be able to defeat me.</b>

13:46.840 --> 13:47.680
<b>Wait, that's—</b>

13:48.090 --> 13:49.720
<b>How he defeated Hiruma...</b>

13:50.550 --> 13:51.970
<b>Hiten Mitsurugi-ryu...</b>

13:52.470 --> 13:53.560
<b>Ryuutsuisen.</b>

14:01.110 --> 14:03.030
<b>You really are a tough one.</b>

14:03.480 --> 14:06.360
<b>You're the first one that didn't fall over</b>

14:06.360 --> 14:08.490
<b>after getting hit with Ryuutsuisen,
that you are.</b>

14:09.410 --> 14:12.330
<b>But I figure you are barely standing,
that you should be.</b>

14:13.330 --> 14:15.830
<b>I'll call for a doctor now,
so wait there, that you will.</b>

14:16.330 --> 14:17.790
<b>Not yet!</b>

14:17.790 --> 14:19.580
<b>It's not over yet!</b>

14:19.750 --> 14:21.380
<b>I haven't fallen!</b>

14:21.380 --> 14:22.630
<b>I haven't lost!</b>

14:22.750 --> 14:25.550
<b>In the name of Sagara
and Sekiho Army,</b>

14:25.550 --> 14:29.300
<b>I can't lose against an Imperialist,
even if it kills me!</b>

14:32.720 --> 14:33.810
<b>Kenshin!</b>

14:33.810 --> 14:34.640
<b>You can't be...</b>

14:34.640 --> 14:36.140
<b>That's right!</b>

14:36.140 --> 14:36.980
<b>Come on, bring it!</b>

14:37.230 --> 14:38.890
<b>Come on, what's the matter?</b>

14:38.890 --> 14:40.440
<b>Come on! Bring it!</b>

14:40.440 --> 14:41.650
<b>Come at me!</b>

14:46.900 --> 14:49.740
<b>Aren't you picking a fight
against the wrong person, that you are?</b>

14:50.160 --> 14:54.950
<b>So the Sekiho Army taught you
to defeat Revolutionary warriors?</b>

14:54.950 --> 14:57.410
<b>Or is it to make the Revolution happen?</b>

14:57.410 --> 14:58.460
<b>Shut up!</b>

14:58.460 --> 14:59.870
<b>I don't want to hear it from you!</b>

15:00.370 --> 15:03.250
<b>You spoke of equality
for the four classes,</b>

15:03.250 --> 15:05.050
<b>yet you drowned in greed,</b>

15:05.050 --> 15:07.380
<b>and you guys are satisfied
making up a fake new era</b>

15:07.380 --> 15:09.340
<b>where only you guys can get all cocky!</b>

15:09.590 --> 15:11.930
<b>So I don't wanna hear it
from an Imperialist!</b>

15:11.930 --> 15:13.010
<b>That's not true!</b>

15:14.140 --> 15:17.060
<b>Kenshin isn't one of those Imperialists!</b>

15:17.640 --> 15:20.440
<b>He doesn't care at all about
an honorable post in the government.</b>

15:20.440 --> 15:23.270
<b>He's a rurouni that keeps freely
protecting people with his sword!</b>

15:24.020 --> 15:27.230
<b>You only know of Kenshin
as Hitokiri Battosai!</b>

15:27.230 --> 15:30.740
<b>Don't you be picking a fight and
spouting off to your heart's content!</b>

15:30.910 --> 15:34.620
<b>That's right! If you're gonna keep at it,
I'll take you on!</b>

15:36.120 --> 15:37.040
<b>Zanza.</b>

15:37.660 --> 15:39.540
<b>The Revolution is not over yet.</b>

15:40.460 --> 15:44.960
<b>It's true that in form,
the Revolution happened ten years ago</b>

15:44.960 --> 15:47.000
<b>and we have entered the new era of Meiji.</b>

15:47.710 --> 15:51.340
<b>However, the people
who truly need happiness</b>

15:51.340 --> 15:55.100
<b>are still trapped in an old time
where the weak are oppressed.</b>

15:56.720 --> 15:59.930
<b>That is why I, in my own humble way,</b>

15:59.930 --> 16:04.480
<b>swing this sword so that I can
be of assistance for those people.</b>

16:05.810 --> 16:08.650
<b>Whether it will be
in a year or in ten years</b>

16:08.650 --> 16:12.360
<b>or if the end of the Revolution
never arrives...</b>

16:13.030 --> 16:13.910
<b>I have no idea.</b>

16:14.410 --> 16:17.490
<b>But I believe that doing this
will be my atonement</b>

16:17.490 --> 16:20.290
<b>for those that fell victim
to the Meiji Revolution.</b>

16:21.750 --> 16:23.330
<b>I believe it will be atonement</b>

16:23.330 --> 16:27.500
<b>for all the people
Hitokiri Battosai has slain, that I do.</b>

16:28.420 --> 16:29.380
<b>It's the same thing.</b>

16:39.810 --> 16:41.600
<b><i>This guy is the same
as Captain Sagara...</i></b>

16:42.770 --> 16:46.940
<b><i>who fought envisioning
his dream of a real new era.</i></b>

16:47.520 --> 16:50.650
<b><i>And he is still continuing his battle...</i></b>

16:52.360 --> 16:55.950
<b><i>while I felt despair, gave up...</i></b>

16:57.370 --> 17:04.420
<b><i>and had been trying to forget about it
all through street fights.</i></b>

17:11.800 --> 17:14.550
<b><i>I'm sorry, Captain Sagara.</i></b>

17:15.550 --> 17:17.510
<b><i>Against this guy, I...</i></b>

17:19.050 --> 17:21.430
<b><i>have suffered a complete defeat.</i></b>

17:29.820 --> 17:32.990
<b>I heard that Zanza's injuries were severe.</b>

17:33.190 --> 17:35.400
<b>Bruises all over and excessive bleeding.</b>

17:35.400 --> 17:39.370
<b>Apparently it will take him three months
to be able to properly move.</b>

17:39.870 --> 17:43.500
<b>Zanza was leagues above
all the others I have faced so far,</b>

17:43.500 --> 17:46.250
<b>so I couldn't quite go easy on him,
that I couldn't.</b>

17:46.670 --> 17:48.130
<b>Hmm?</b>

17:50.880 --> 17:52.300
<b>Is something the matter, that is?</b>

17:52.840 --> 17:57.090
<b>You know, you shouldn't be
all depressed forever.</b>

17:57.090 --> 17:59.300
<b>Oh, no, it's not that I—</b>

17:59.600 --> 18:03.470
<b>Kenshin, I think Zanza
had a point with what he said,</b>

18:03.970 --> 18:06.390
<b>but you're not that type
of Imperialist, are you?</b>

18:06.770 --> 18:10.190
<b>I'm sure that point got across
to Zanza as well yesterday.</b>

18:11.320 --> 18:14.070
<b>I'm sure he understood as well,
as stupid as he may be.</b>

18:14.400 --> 18:16.030
<b>So don't worry about it.</b>

18:16.650 --> 18:18.240
<b>Thank you very much, that is.</b>

18:19.570 --> 18:22.870
<b>BEEF HOT-POT AND SAKE
AKABEKO RESTAURANT</b>

18:20.450 --> 18:24.750
<b>How about we change things up a bit
and splurge by eating some beef hot-pot?</b>

18:24.750 --> 18:25.660
<b>Again?</b>

18:30.500 --> 18:31.420
<b>Oro?</b>

18:31.420 --> 18:33.250
<b>You guys are from the other day...</b>

18:33.250 --> 18:34.380
<b>Sheesh.</b>

18:35.210 --> 18:38.180
<b>I don't care if you get drunk
and pick a fight with me,</b>

18:38.180 --> 18:41.600
<b>but can you at least do that
after you train a bit and get stronger?</b>

18:42.560 --> 18:43.390
<b>Zanza?</b>

18:44.270 --> 18:46.850
<b>Yo. Thanks for takin' care
of me yesterday.</b>

18:47.350 --> 18:50.810
<b>You can already get up and about,
that you can?</b>

18:51.020 --> 18:54.360
<b>Heh! My sales pitch is
how I'm able to take a lot of hits.</b>

18:54.360 --> 18:55.990
<b>That was nothin'.</b>

18:58.740 --> 18:59.570
<b>Poke.</b>

18:59.570 --> 19:00.610
<b>- Poke.
- Poke.</b>

19:03.030 --> 19:05.740
<b>My sales pitch...
is how I'm able...</b>

19:05.740 --> 19:07.870
<b>to take a lot of hits.
That was... nothin'.</b>

19:07.870 --> 19:10.210
<b>He's grinning and bearing quite a bit.</b>

19:12.130 --> 19:12.920
<b>Zanza.</b>

19:12.920 --> 19:16.380
<b>You're not going to remove the "bad"
on your back, that you aren't?</b>

19:12.920 --> 19:16.380
<b>BAD</b>

19:16.590 --> 19:21.930
<b>Yeah. For me, the Sekiho Army is a past
I can't forget, so I can't take it off.</b>

19:21.930 --> 19:23.600
<b>And you say my personality is warped...</b>

19:24.390 --> 19:29.480
<b>but that's something I can't
do anything about now that I'm 19.</b>

19:30.060 --> 19:32.150
<b>Even what you said yesterday,</b>

19:32.150 --> 19:34.770
<b>I think about how you can say
anything you feel like saying.</b>

19:35.980 --> 19:36.980
<b>So, you know,</b>

19:37.190 --> 19:41.110
<b>how different are you from those
fraud Imperialists that are all talk?</b>

19:41.740 --> 19:45.280
<b>I'll be shadowing you from now on
to figure it out with my own eyes.</b>

19:47.160 --> 19:48.790
<b>And one more thing.</b>

19:48.790 --> 19:50.620
<b>I'm not Zanza anymore.</b>

19:50.620 --> 19:53.710
<b>I don't have my zanbato anymore,
and I stopped being a fighter for hire.</b>

19:54.170 --> 19:57.710
<b>I'm just plain old Sanosuke Sagara,
a guy that likes to fight.</b>

19:58.300 --> 20:01.930
<b>Just like how you are no longer
the Hitokiri Battosai.</b>

20:04.390 --> 20:05.800
<b>So there you have it.</b>

20:05.800 --> 20:10.060
<b>You better not wander away from here
without my permission, Kenshin!</b>

20:11.140 --> 20:12.230
<b>Good grief.</b>

20:13.060 --> 20:15.230
<b>We have yet another strange one,
that we do.</b>

20:18.280 --> 20:19.320
<b>Ms. Tae?</b>

20:19.860 --> 20:22.780
<b>Mr. Sanosuke ran off without paying again.</b>

20:23.070 --> 20:24.490
<b>Oro?</b>

22:07.220 --> 22:10.850
<b>Pl-Please. I'll give you
as much money as you want.</b>

22:10.850 --> 22:13.390
<b>So, pl-please, spare my life...</b>

22:14.480 --> 22:19.360
<b>So the old Revolutionary warrior
has gone senile bathing in all that money?</b>

22:24.780 --> 22:28.450
<b>Wh-What? I can't move my body!</b>

22:28.450 --> 22:29.700
<b>What's going on?</b>

22:35.160 --> 22:37.830
<b>Die.</b>

22:44.960 --> 22:49.970
<b>NEXT EPISODE
KUROGASA</b>

22:46.010 --> 22:48.300
<b><i>Next episode, "Kurogasa."</i></b>
